-      text: A few lessons inside a waves unit, where students investigate and argue from evidence about something they can observe. The class are experienced inquirers.
+      text: 6–8 lessons inside a waves unit, where students investigate and argue from evidence about something they can observe. The class are experienced inquirers.
     profile:
